      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For those that checkback here, The checkmark on the sheild publically announces the user has undergone Personas/VRChats Age verification process.\n\nThe user gets this checkmark if the user is Over **OR** Under the age\n\n**This unknowning announces age to those who could be hiding the 18+ badge or not having it at all**",
